    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(a)(1) of the Land Reform Act, No. 01 of 1972 amended by the Acts No. 39 of 1975, No. 14 of 1981, No. 39 of 1981, No. 18 of 1986, I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby alienate the agricultural lands speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule below which had been vested in the Land Reform Commission, in terms of the provisions of the aforesaid Act, by way of sale, to the Road Development Authority, established by the Act No. 73 of 1981 as per the Section 22(1)bb of the said Land Reform Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
