      543.39,
      549.68,
      576.73
    ],
    "text": "(1) I hereby alienate the land speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule below for a sum of Two Million Four Hundred and Fifty Four Thousand Rupees (Rs. 2,454,000/-), in consideration of the aforesaid sale to the said Road Development Authority.",
